  {
    "type": "page",
    "title": "Learning Management System",
    "description": "Road code questions that you can practice for free for car, motorbike or heavy vehicle",
    "content": "<div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-8 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\">\n  <div aria-labelledby=\"lms-hero-title\" class=\"space-y-10\">\n    <div>\n      <h1 id=\"lms-hero-title\" class=\"text-4xl font-bold leading-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl\">\n        A World-Class Learning Management System,<br>\n        Included Free with Every Course\n      </h1>\n    </div>\n\n    <figure>\n      <img class=\"h-auto w-full rounded-2xl\" src=\"https://www.drivingtests.co.nz/images/page/lms/hero-collage.png\" alt=\"Driving Tests LMS previews showing certificates, dashboard reports, digital ID cards and course screens\">\n    </figure>\n\n    <div class=\"grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-start\">\n      <div>\n        <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 sm:text-3xl\">\n          Everything you need to manage training.<br>\n          No additional costs.\n        </h2>\n        <div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-4\">\n          <a class=\"rounded-lg bg-blue-600 px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-blue-700\" href=\"/resources/contact-us/\">Arrange a demo</a>\n          <a class=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-slate-900 transition hover:bg-slate-100\" href=\"/courses/\">Explore our courses</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"space-y-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-700\">\n        <p><strong class=\"text-slate-900\">Every DT course purchase includes complete access to our powerful Learning Management System (LMS) at no extra charge.</strong> There are no per-user charges or hidden fees—just a straightforward, easy-to-use platform for training, monitoring progress, and maintaining compliance, whether you have one trainee or 100,000.</p>\n        <p>More than 3,000 companies throughout New Zealand use our LMS. It is designed for genuine workplaces, vehicles, and day-to-day compliance requirements.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div aria-labelledby=\"lms-simple-title\" class=\"mt-20\">\n    <h2 id=\"lms-simple-title\" class=\"mb-8 text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900\">Simple, Stress-Free Learning Management</h2>\n\n    <div class=\"rounded-2xl bg-slate-100 p-6 sm:p-8\">\n      <div class=\"grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center\">\n        <img class=\"h-auto w-full rounded-xl\" src=\"https://www.drivingtests.co.nz/images/page/lms/lms-invite-unlimited-trainees.jpg\" alt=\"Invite trainee interface preview\">\n        <div>\n          <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900\">Invite unlimited trainees</h3>\n          <p class=\"mt-4 leading-relaxed text-slate-700\">Purchase the courses you require, then invite trainees by email or add them using a username. There are no limits on users and no continuing licence charges.</p>\n          <p class=\"mt-4 text-slate-700\"><strong>Benefit:</strong> <em>Expand your training programme without added costs or complicated administration.</em></p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"mt-10 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3\">\n        <div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-white shadow-sm\">\n          <img class=\"h-auto w-full\" src=\"https://www.drivingtests.co.nz/images/page/lms/lms-dashboard.jpg\" alt=\"LMS dashboard analytics preview\">\n          <div class=\"p-6\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900\">Powerful Analytics &amp; Reporting</h3>\n            <p class=\"mt-4 leading-relaxed text-slate-700\">Monitor progress, completion percentages, assessment outcomes, and compliance status in real time. Create and download reports with only a few clicks.</p>\n            <p class=\"mt-4 text-slate-700\"><strong>Benefit:</strong> <em>See immediately who has completed training, who is overdue, and where follow-up is required.</em></p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-white shadow-sm\">\n          <img class=\"h-auto w-full\" src=\"https://www.drivingtests.co.nz/images/page/lms/role-management.png\" alt=\"Role based management diagram\">\n          <div class=\"p-6\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900\">Group &amp; Role-Based Management</h3>\n            <p class=\"mt-4 font-semibold text-slate-900\">Organise trainees into groups</p>\n            <p class=\"mt-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-700\">Arrange trainees by site, department, job role, shift, vehicle type, and more for simpler administration.</p>\n            <p class=\"mt-4 font-semibold text-slate-900\">Add managers and supervisors</p>\n            <p class=\"mt-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-700\">Provide managers with access to supervise their teams and coordinate training.</p>\n            <p class=\"mt-4 text-slate-700\"><strong>Benefit:</strong> <em>Distribute responsibility while retaining oversight and control.</em></p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-white shadow-sm\">\n          <img class=\"h-auto w-full\" src=\"https://www.drivingtests.co.nz/images/page/lms/mobile-app.png\" alt=\"Mobile training app preview\">\n          <div class=\"p-6\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900\">Train Anywhere with Our Free Mobile App</h3>\n            <p class=\"mt-4 leading-relaxed text-slate-700\">Our free iOS and Android apps allow trainees to learn whenever and wherever it suits them—on site, in the cab, or at home.</p>\n            <p class=\"mt-4 text-slate-700\"><strong>Benefit:</strong> <em>No desktop computer is needed. Training can fit around real working hours.</em></p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div aria-labelledby=\"lms-records-title\" class=\"mt-20\">\n    <h2 id=\"lms-records-title\" class=\"mb-8 text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900\">Certificates, Digital ID Cards, Records &amp; Accessibility</h2>\n\n    <div class=\"rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 p-6 text-white sm:p-8\">\n      <div class=\"grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center\">\n        <img class=\"h-auto w-full rounded-xl\" src=\"https://www.drivingtests.co.nz/images/page/lms/cert-wallet.png\" alt=\"Digital certificate wallet preview\">\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-yellow-300\">Automatically create:</p>\n          <ul class=\"mt-5 space-y-4\">\n            <li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><img class=\"h-8 w-8\" src=\"https://www.drivingtests.co.nz/images/page/lms/icon-course-completion.png\" alt=\"\">Course completion certificates</li>\n            <li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><img class=\"h-8 w-8\" src=\"https://www.drivingtests.co.nz/images/page/lms/icon-phone-id.png\" alt=\"\">Digital identification cards</li>\n            <li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><img class=\"h-8 w-8\" src=\"https://www.drivingtests.co.nz/images/page/lms/icon-training-records.svg\" alt=\"\">Centralised training records</li>\n          </ul>\n          <p class=\"mt-6\"><strong>Benefit:</strong> <em>Evidence of competency is always ready when auditors or customers request it.</em></p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"mt-10 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3\">\n        <div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-slate-800\">\n          <img class=\"h-auto w-full\" src=\"https://www.drivingtests.co.nz/images/page/lms/lms-stay-compliant.jpg\" alt=\"Automated reminders preview\">\n          <div class=\"p-6\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold\">Stay Compliant with Automated Reminders</h3>\n            <p class=\"mt-4 leading-relaxed text-slate-200\">Schedule notifications for training, licences, and competencies that are approaching expiry.</p>\n            <p class=\"mt-4 text-slate-200\"><strong>Benefit:</strong> <em>Avoid missing another renewal or compliance deadline.</em></p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-slate-800\">\n          <img class=\"h-auto w-full\" src=\"https://www.drivingtests.co.nz/images/page/lms/records.png\" alt=\"Training records table preview\">\n          <div class=\"p-6\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold\">Manage All Your Training Records</h3>\n            <p class=\"mt-4 font-semibold text-slate-100\">Track more than DT courses, including:</p>\n            <ul class=\"mt-3 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-slate-200\">\n              <li>External courses</li>\n              <li>Internal training</li>\n              <li>Site inductions</li>\n              <li>Licences and endorsements</li>\n            </ul>\n            <p class=\"mt-4 text-slate-200\"><strong>Benefit:</strong> <em>Keep everything in one system and maintain a single source of truth.</em></p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-slate-800\">\n          <img class=\"h-auto w-full\" src=\"https://www.drivingtests.co.nz/images/page/lms/lms-language-literacy.jpg\" alt=\"Language support preview\">\n          <div class=\"p-6\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold\">Built for a Diverse Workforce</h3>\n            <p class=\"mt-4 font-semibold text-slate-100\">Multilingual and literacy-friendly:</p>\n            <ul class=\"mt-3 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-slate-200\">\n              <li>Subtitles in 25 languages</li>\n              <li>Assessment questions in 76 languages</li>\n              <li>English audio recordings for every question</li>\n            </ul>\n            <p class=\"mt-4 text-slate-200\"><strong>Benefit:</strong> <em>Accessible training for ESL learners and people with different literacy levels.</em></p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div aria-labelledby=\"lms-engaging-title\" class=\"mt-20\">\n    <h2 id=\"lms-engaging-title\" class=\"mb-8 text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900\">Engaging Learning</h2>\n\n    <div class=\"rounded-2xl bg-blue-50 p-6 sm:p-8\">\n      <div class=\"grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2\">\n        <div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-white shadow-sm\">\n          <img class=\"h-auto w-full\" src=\"https://www.drivingtests.co.nz/images/page/lms/lms-engaging-learning.jpg\" alt=\"Interactive EWP course preview\">\n          <div class=\"p-6\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900\">Engaging, Modern Learning Experience</h3>\n            <p class=\"mt-4 font-semibold text-slate-900\">Our courses are:</p>\n            <ul class=\"mt-3 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-slate-700\">\n              <li>Video-based</li>\n              <li>Interactive</li>\n              <li>Built around real-world situations</li>\n            </ul>\n            <p class=\"mt-4 text-slate-700\"><strong>Benefit:</strong> <em>More engagement and improved completion rates compared with text-only training.</em></p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-white shadow-sm\">\n          <img class=\"h-auto w-full\" src=\"https://www.drivingtests.co.nz/images/page/lms/lms-practical-tools.jpg\" alt=\"Load plate cheat sheet preview\">\n          <div class=\"p-6\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900\">Practical Tools Included</h3>\n            <p class=\"mt-4 font-semibold text-slate-900\">Downloadable documents and checklists can help you:</p>\n            <ul class=\"mt-3 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-slate-700\">\n              <li>Manage vehicles and machinery</li>\n              <li>Support workplace safety processes</li>\n              <li>Reinforce learning on the job</li>\n              <li>Develop SOPs and policies</li>\n            </ul>\n            <p class=\"mt-4 text-slate-700\"><strong>Benefit:</strong> <em>Training that contributes directly to everyday operations.</em></p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"mt-10 rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8\">\n        <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900\">Get Started Today</h3>\n        <p class=\"mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-700\">There is no software to purchase, licensing agreement to negotiate, or new platform to implement.</p>\n\n        <ol class=\"mt-6 space-y-4\">\n          <li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><img class=\"h-8 w-8\" src=\"https://www.drivingtests.co.nz/images/page/lms/icon-step-purchase.png\" alt=\"\">Purchase a course.</li>\n          <li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><img class=\"h-8 w-8\" src=\"https://www.drivingtests.co.nz/images/page/lms/icon-step-invite.png\" alt=\"\">Invite your team.</li>\n          <li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><img class=\"h-8 w-8\" src=\"https://www.drivingtests.co.nz/images/page/lms/icon-step-start.png\" alt=\"\">Begin training.</li>\n        </ol>\n\n        <p class=\"mt-8 font-semibold text-slate-900\">Not sure which option to choose?</p>\n        <div class=\"mt-4 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row\">\n          <a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-blue-600 px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-white hover:bg-blue-700\" href=\"/courses/\">\n            <img class=\"h-6 w-6\" src=\"https://www.drivingtests.co.nz/images/page/lms/icon-browse-courses.png\" alt=\"\">Browse courses\n            <img class=\"h-5 w-5\" src=\"https://www.drivingtests.co.nz/images/page/lms/icon-chevron-right.png\" alt=\"\">\n          </a>\n          <a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-100\" href=\"/resources/contact-us/\">\n            <img class=\"h-6 w-6\" src=\"https://www.drivingtests.co.nz/images/page/lms/icon-talk-team.png\" alt=\"\">Speak with our team\n            <img class=\"h-5 w-5\" src=\"https://www.drivingtests.co.nz/images/page/lms/icon-chevron-right.png\" alt=\"\">\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
